  ],
  "Seed_Compilation_Status": "Successful",
  "Trigger_Explanation": "The bug is triggered by calling the method showBug, which calls a finalize method that is not overriding Object.finalize(). The JVM throws an AbstractMethodError as it expects the method to be present in the superclass.",
